<page-meta page-style="{{appThemeStyle}}" />
<view class="page nutrition-page theme-{{theme}}"><view class="heading">先算需求，再安排三餐</view><view class="intro">根据身高、当前体重和活动量，估算每日热量与营养分配。</view><button wx:if="{{result}}" class="plan-shortcut" bindtap="viewPlan">查看已生成的计划 ↓</button><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="card">正在加载…</view><block wx:else>
<view class="card section-strategy"><view class="card-title">选择饮食方案</view><view class="note">选择符合自己作息的饮食方式。16:8 调整每天的进食时间；5:2 区分一周内的正常饮食日和低能量日。研究未显示这些方案普遍优于持续控制总热量。</view><view wx:for="{{strategies}}" wx:key="key" class="strategy-option {{form.strategy === item.key ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="chooseStrategy"><view class="strategy-title">{{item.name}}<text>{{form.strategy === item.key ? '已选' : '选择'}}</text></view><view class="strategy-tag">{{item.tag}}</view><view class="note">{{item.description}}</view></view><view class="strategy-note">{{selectedStrategy.note}}</view>
<block wx:if="{{selectedStrategy.hours}}"><picker mode="time" value="{{form.windowStart}}" data-field="windowStart" bindchange="edit" disabled="{{saving}}"><view class="field"><text>进食窗口开始时间</text><text>{{form.windowStart}} ▾</text></view></picker><view class="note">每天 {{selectedStrategy.hours}} 小时内安排所有餐次和加餐。其余时间可以饮水，不限制饮水；头晕、乏力或明显不适时停止禁食并评估。</view><view class="field stack"><text class="note">无糖尿病降糖用药、需随餐用药、反复低血糖等情况；不在孕哺期，无进食障碍。用药者应先咨询医生。</text><switch checked="{{form.fastingSuitable}}" bindchange="fastingSuitable" disabled="{{saving}}" /><text class="note">我确认适合尝试限时进食</text></view></block>
</view>
<view wx:if="{{form.strategy === 'fiveTwo'}}" class="card section-screening"><view class="card-title">5:2 个别情况筛查</view><view class="note">仅为 19～64 岁、BMI ≥25、以减重为目标且未报告排除项的人生成一周参考草案。该产品筛查不能代替诊疗。</view>
<picker wx:for="{{riskQuestions}}" wx:key="key" range="{{riskOptions}}" value="{{riskIndexes[item.key] || 0}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindchange="riskChange" disabled="{{saving}}"><view class="field stack"><text>{{item.label}}</text><text>{{riskOptions[riskIndexes[item.key] || 0]}} ▾</text></view></picker>
<view class="field stack"><text>选择两个不连续的低能量日</text><checkbox-group class="weekday-grid" bindchange="lowDays"><label wx:for="{{weekdays}}" wx:key="*this" class="weekday-choice"><checkbox value="{{index}}" checked="{{form.lowDays[0] == index || form.lowDays[1] == index}}" disabled="{{saving}}" />{{item}}</label></checkbox-group></view>
<view class="field stack"><text>低能量日不安排高强度训练或重体力工作</text><switch checked="{{form.trainingReviewed}}" data-field="trainingReviewed" bindchange="assessmentSwitch" disabled="{{saving}}" /></view></view>
<block><view class="card section-profile"><view class="card-title">你的基础资料</view><view class="note">请填写当前情况，不要使用目标体重。首次估算需自行确认资料。</view>
<view class="field"><text>年龄 · 岁</text><input type="number" value="{{form.age}}" data-field="age" bindinput="edit" placeholder="19～78" disabled="{{saving}}" /></view>
<view class="field"><text>身高 · cm</text><input type="digit" value="{{form.height}}" data-field="height" bindinput="edit" placeholder="例如 170" disabled="{{saving}}" /></view>
<view class="field"><text>当前体重 · kg</text><input type="digit" value="{{form.weight}}" data-field="weight" bindinput="edit" placeholder="例如 65" disabled="{{saving}}" /></view>
<picker range="{{sexNames}}" value="{{sexIndex}}" bindchange="chooseSex" disabled="{{saving}}"><view class="field"><text>代谢公式使用的生理性别</text><text>{{sexNames[sexIndex]}} ▾</text></view></picker>
<picker range="{{goalNames}}" value="{{goalIndex}}" bindchange="chooseGoal" disabled="{{saving}}"><view class="field"><text>目标</text><text>{{goalNames[goalIndex]}} ▾</text></view></picker></view>
<view class="card section-activity"><view class="card-title">日常活动和运动</view><view class="note">日常活动不含专门锻炼；运动按一周平均分配，不再叠加运动记录中的消耗。</view>
<picker range="{{activity}}" range-key="label" value="{{form.activity}}" data-field="activity" bindchange="edit" disabled="{{saving}}"><view class="field stack"><text>日常活动</text><text>{{activity[form.activity].label}} ▾</text></view></picker>
<view class="field"><text>每周运动 · 天</text><input type="number" value="{{form.days}}" data-field="days" bindinput="edit" disabled="{{saving}}" /></view>
<block wx:if="{{form.days > 0}}"><view class="field"><text>每次平均 · 分钟</text><input type="number" value="{{form.minutes}}" data-field="minutes" bindinput="edit" disabled="{{saving}}" /></view><picker range="{{intensity}}" range-key="label" value="{{form.intensity}}" data-field="intensity" bindchange="edit" disabled="{{saving}}"><view class="field stack"><text>平均运动强度</text><text>{{intensity[form.intensity].label}} ▾</text></view></picker></block>
<view class="field"><text>安排加餐</text><switch checked="{{form.snack}}" data-field="snack" bindchange="edit" disabled="{{saving}}" /></view></view>
<view class="card section-screening"><view class="note">适用于一般健康成年人。孕哺期、进食障碍或需治疗饮食（如肾病等）不使用此通用估算。</view><radio-group bindchange="suitable"><label><radio value="adult" checked="{{form.suitability === 'adult'}}" disabled="{{saving}}" />我符合上述适用范围</label></radio-group></view>
<view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><button class="btn-primary" bindtap="generate" disabled="{{saving}}">{{form.strategy === 'fiveTwo' ? '评估并生成一周参考草案' : '生成每日营养计划'}}</button>
<view wx:if="{{result}}" id="nutrition-result"><view class="card result-card"><view class="card-title">{{result.strategyName}}</view><view wx:if="{{result.eatingWindow}}" class="window-result">每天进食窗口 {{result.eatingWindow}}</view><view class="note">{{result.strategy === 'fiveTwo' ? '正常饮食日参考目标' : '每日参考目标'}}</view><view class="calories">{{result.calories}}<text> kcal / 天</text></view><view class="macros"><view><text>蛋白质 · 25%</text><view>{{result.protein}} g</view></view><view><text>碳水 · 45%</text><view>{{result.carb}} g</view></view><view><text>脂肪 · 30%</text><view>{{result.fat}} g</view></view></view><view class="note">比例为通用起始方案，并非唯一最佳比例；克数四舍五入后，热量可能有少量误差。</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{result.strategy !== 'fiveTwo'}}" class="card section-meals"><view class="card-title">每天怎么分配</view><view wx:for="{{result.meals}}" wx:key="name" class="meal"><view class="meal-title">{{item.name}} · {{item.calories}} kcal <text>{{item.percent}}%</text></view><view class="note">蛋白质 {{item.protein}} g · 碳水 {{item.carb}} g · 脂肪 {{item.fat}} g</view></view><view class="note">这是营养目标，不是已吃下的食物，也不会自动计入饮食记录。</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{result.strategy === 'fiveTwo'}}" class="card section-meals"><view class="card-title">{{result.start}} 至 {{result.end}}</view><view class="note">{{result.assessment}}。低能量日是待专业确认的估算，三大营养素比例不代表微量营养素或蛋白质需求已满足。</view><view class="week-hint">点击某一天查看营养配比</view><view wx:for="{{result.week}}" wx:key="date" class="week-day compact-day {{item.isLow ? 'low-day' : ''}}"><view class="week-row" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="toggleDay"><view class="week-label"><text>{{item.weekday}} · {{item.type}}</text><text class="week-date">{{item.date}}</text></view><view class="week-energy">{{item.calories}} kcal <text>{{expandedDay === index ? '⌃' : '⌄'}}</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{expandedDay === index}}" class="day-detail">蛋白质 {{item.protein}} g · 碳水 {{item.carb}} g · 脂肪 {{item.fat}} g</view></view><view class="note">七天总计 {{result.weeklyCalories}} kcal。正常日不暴食补偿；不限制饮水。不适时停止并寻求专业意见。此计划仅覆盖上述七天，不自动无限重复。</view><view class="field stack"><text class="note">我已让医生或营养师确认低能量日热量、营养安排和用药要求。</text><switch checked="{{form.professionalConfirmed}}" data-field="professionalConfirmed" bindchange="assessmentSwitch" disabled="{{saving}}" /></view><view class="note">仅勾选不等于获得医疗评估，请如实确认。</view></view>
<view class="card section-basis"><view class="card-title basis-toggle" bindtap="toggleBasis">估算依据与说明 <text>{{showBasis ? '收起 ⌃' : '展开 ⌄'}}</text></view><block wx:if="{{showBasis}}"><view class="note">静息代谢约 {{result.resting}} kcal × 日常活动系数 {{result.factor}} ＋ 运动日均净消耗约 {{result.movement}} kcal。维持热量约 {{result.maintenance}} kcal；{{result.adjustment}}。</view><view wx:if="{{result.floorApplied}}" class="note">本次估算触及保守下限，已上调目标，建议咨询营养师确认。</view><view class="note">运动强度、活动系数和目标调整幅度是简化估算。参考执行 2～4 周，结合体重趋势、饥饿感和训练恢复再调整，不因单日体重变化大幅减少饮食。</view><button size="mini" bindtap="copySources">查看依据链接</button></block></view>
<button class="btn-primary" bindtap="apply" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving || saved || (result.strategy === 'fiveTwo' && !form.professionalConfirmed)}}">{{saved ? '已应用计划' : result.strategy === 'fiveTwo' ? '确认并应用这一周计划' : '确认并应用每日目标'}}</button><view class="note footer">{{result.strategy === 'fiveTwo' ? '5:2 周计划仅保存在本机。上述日期内，首页和饮食页使用对应日期的目标；到期或换设备后恢复账号中的固定目标。' : '应用后更新首页与饮食页的热量目标及营养目标。计算资料保存在本机，目标保存在你的账号中。'}}</view></view></block></block></view>

<view class="nutrition-navigation"><button class="home-link" bindtap="goHome" disabled="{{saving}}">返回首页</button><button class="diet-link" bindtap="goDiet" disabled="{{saving}}">去饮食记录</button></view>
